  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1306.06 Contracting Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1306.06 Contracting Procedures. Grant recipients shall comply with all applicable federal, state, and local contracting requirements when contracting for services to control or eradicate infestations of exotic aquatic weeds.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300) #8703-A, eff 9-5-06; ss by #10696, eff 10-18-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300); ss bv #14186, eff 1-25-25",
